# Play test of Thornwood (CIPlay thornwood, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe (from the land centre
# of the finished land): the camp on the south beach, the rope bridge over the gorge at x -20, the shrines, the temple
# on the hill at 15 25 (23.4 m). The quest's 21 steps: the camp, the diary, the map; the Shrine of the Roots and its
# tusk; the gorge's rim, the bridge's carved post, the bridge; the trail to the falls, the Shrine of the Falls and its
# tusk, a wild beehive, the Shrine of the Hill and the third tusk; the boar trail, the temple, the Boar King and his
# guards, the boar idol, the offering (the machete); the two vine caches.
island Thornwood
expect step 0
expect title The Boar King of Thornwood

# The explorer's camp: the diary and the map
walk -50 -78 to -45 -74 h=3
zone camp
expect step 1
read Explorer's diary
expect step 2
read Map of Thornwood
expect step 3

# The Shrine of the Roots, this side of the gorge (its tusk counted at once)
open Shrine of the Roots
expect story tusk 1
expect step 5

# Up to the rope bridge past the gorge's rim (the walk passes it): the carved post at its south end, and across
walk -45 -70 to -40 -60 to -32 -50 to -25 -40 to -20 -33 h=14
zone gorgerim
expect step 6
read Carved post
expect step 7
walk -20 -33 to -20 -22 to -20 -12 h=13.2
expect stand -20.75 -22 h=13.6
zone bridge
expect step 8

# The trail to the falls, the Shrine of the Falls; a wild beehive; the temple's chest stays shut with two tusks
zone falls
expect step 9
open Shrine of the Falls
expect story tusk 2
expect step 11
open Wild beehive
expect step 12
open Temple offering
expect message won't open without three
expect story tusk 2

# The Shrine of the Hill
open Shrine of the Hill
expect story tusk 3
expect step 14

# Up the boar trail into the stone ring (the walk passes the trail's zone; opening the temple's chest above took the
# player into the ring, so that step is credited with it): the Boar King and his guards
walk -20 -12 to -10 0 to 0 10 to 10 18 to 15 21 h=23.4
zone hilltrail
expect step 16
zone temple
expect message Boar King
kill Warthog
expect step 17
expect animals Warthog 0
read The boar idol
expect step 18
open Temple offering
wait 2
expect story tusk 0
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect step 20

# The machete: the explorer's two caches behind the vines
expect hidden thornvine2
use thornvines2
expect shown thornvine2
open Vine cache by the temple
expect step 21
use thornvines1
expect shown thornvine1
open Vine cache by the camp
expect done
